      "exampleEnglish": "The book is easy.",
      "grammarNote": "Nothing new grammatically — a definite noun followed directly by an adjective, the equational sentence pattern from level 11. This level is vocabulary only: نَظِيف/وَسِخ ('clean'/'dirty') for the household nouns from level 69, and سَهْل/صَعْب ('easy'/'difficult') for describing lessons, exercises, or anything else.",
